# Agentic UI contracts

Before changing agent instructions, tools, AG-UI/CopilotKit rendering, A2UI/DSL,
or tool-result presentation, read `docs/adr/0001-agentic-ui-contracts.md`.

Make the AI choose the correct tool with complete typed intent. Return
authoritative component data from that tool and render its validated contract.
Fix incorrect calls at the tool/schema/instruction boundary. Do not merge,
rewrite, suppress or fabricate semantic tool results to compensate in the UI.
JSON decoding and schema validation remain required.

Use `docs/research/agentic-ui-contract-audit-2026-09-10.md` to distinguish
existing migration debt from approved protocol and component behavior.
